sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as Client Agent (OpenClaw)
    participant Ecom as E-Commerce API (Shopee Mock)
    participant PG as Payment Gateway (Backend)
    participant LLM as Policy Evaluator (Qwen)

    Note over Agent, Ecom: Browser Automation / Protocol
    Note over Agent, PG: Tool Integration (Athena MCP)
    Note over Ecom, PG: Server-to-Server REST API

    Agent->>Ecom: Initiate Shopping Session (Browse/Cart)
    Ecom-->>Agent: Return Product/Cart Data

    Agent->>Ecom: Submit Checkout Request
    
    Ecom->>PG: Create Payment Intent (Amount, Merchant Token, Category)
    PG-->>Ecom: Return Transaction ID
    
    Ecom-->>Agent: Acknowledge Checkout & Provide Transaction ID
    Note right of Agent: Agent triggers Athena MCP tool<br/>for payment authorization
    
    Agent->>PG: Authorize Payment (Account ID, Transaction ID)
    
    activate PG
    PG->>PG: Validate Account Balance & Limits
    
    PG->>LLM: Evaluate Purchase Relevance vs. Account Purpose
    activate LLM
    LLM-->>PG: Evaluation Verdict (Approved/Rejected)
    deactivate LLM
    
    PG-->>Ecom: Payment Status Callback (Transaction Success)
    deactivate PG
    
    Ecom-->>Agent: Order Confirmation (Transaction Complete)